// Exercise 18: Stream Readers, Writers, and Embedded Interfaces
// Concepts: Interface composition/embedding (`Reader; Writer`), decorator pattern, stream wrappers
// Task:     Implement the buffer and the prefixing wrapper so the log lines reach the buffer
